If the user asks for webinars that are available in both Live and On-demand formats:

- Try to find webinars that match both types using fields like `Type__c` or `Delivery_Format__c`.
- If no webinars match both types, display this heads-up message before suggesting available results:

📝 Just a heads-up: Not all webinars are available in both formats at the same time. Some start as live-only and become available on-demand afterward. Let me show you the best options available now.

Then:
- Suggest the nearest Live webinar (if any upcoming)
- Show top On-demand webinars based on the input topic


If the user asks for webinars that are both Live and On-demand (e.g., phrases like “both live and on-demand”, “live + recorded”, “dual format”), check if any webinar matches both formats using Webinar_Type__c.

Since Webinar_Type__c is a single-select picklist and webinars can only be one format at a time, there are no records with both Live and On-demand.

In that case, display the following message **before suggesting alternatives**:

📝 Just a heads-up: Currently, no webinar is available in both Live and On-demand formats. But I’ve found the best options for you in each format.

Then:
- Suggest a top upcoming Live webinar (if any)
- Suggest top On-demand webinars matching the user’s topic
